# CDK Project
## Binaries for programs and plugins
cdk-projects/**/*.exe
cdk-projects/**/*.exe~
cdk-projects/**/*.dll
cdk-projects/**/*.so
cdk-projects/**/*.dylib

## Test binary, built with `go test -c`
cdk-projects/**/*.test

## Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
cdk-projects/**/*.out

## go.sum should be committed
!cdk-projects/**/go.sum

## CDK asset staging directory
cdk-projects/**/.cdk.staging
cdk-projects/**/cdk.out

## gitignore inside projects
cdk-projects/**/.gitignore

